_20112026.pdf", "attchmntText": "Belrise Industries Limited has informed the Exchange about Transcript of earnings call held on November 16, 2026.", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates", "difference": "00:00:00", "dt": "20112026112454", "exchdisstime": "20-Nov-2026 11:24:54", "fileSize": "411.30 KB", "hasXbrl": true, "nasUploadFlag": null, "objUploadFlag": null, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "106867131", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE894V01022", "sm_name": "Belrise Industries Limited", "sort_date": "2026-11-20 11:24:54", "symbol": "BELRISE", "voiceSummary": "Belrise Industries Limited filed the transcript of its Q2 and H1 FY27 earnings call with BSE and NSE. The company reported a profit after tax of INR1,663 million for Q2 FY27. Total revenue from operations stood at INR27,464 million, up 17% year-on-year. EBITDA was INR3,306 million with a margin of 12.0%. The company entered the ecosystem of a major American smartphone manufacturer with an order for precision tooling. It secured a new facility in Dharwad for complete chassis assemblies for a commercial vehicle OEM, with ramp-up in Q1 FY28. A new facility in Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar was established for three-wheeler body assemblies, also ramping up in Q1 FY28. The company won sheet metal orders from Japanese and European passenger vehicle OEMs. It onboarded a sixth OEM customer for its suspension business. Return on capital employed improved to 15.3%. The transcript is available on the company website.", "voiceUrl": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/ann_voice/BELRISE_20112026112442_BELRISE_Intimation_of_Transcript_of_earnings_call_20112026.mp3"}, {"an_dt": "16-Nov-2026 16:47:58", "attFilePath": null, "attFileSize": "154.74 KB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/corporate/BELRISE_16112026164737_BELRISE_Intimation_of_Audio_Recording.pdf", "attchmntText": "Belrise Industries Limited has informed the Exchange about Link of Reco